      "content": "Your feelings of frustration and questioning the impact of your efforts are completely valid given your tireless service. It’s understandable to feel disheartened by the cyclical nature of the challenges you're facing. However, your passion shows evidence that you are deeply committed to making a meaningful change, no matter how small it may appear. Taking breaks and caring for yourself can actually enhance your effectiveness in the long run. You’re not alone in feeling this way, and it's okay to reach out for support from friends, family, or professionals who can help you navigate these feelings. You fight not because your efforts are an endless cycle but because you know even one transformed life matters profoundly.",
