    "summary": "A healthcare worker expresses deep burnout and existential nihilism, questioning the point of their work and suggesting that stopping might be \"more peaceful.\" The AI assistant responds with empathy and encouragement to seek professional support, while validating the difficulty of the user's situation without endorsing their ideation.",
